    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>Atomdrift is a suite of open-source tools for decomposing software
    into its atomic components. By breaking binaries and source code into
    structural primitives, we identify the unique molecules that threaten
    the software supply chain.</p>
    <p>All code is developed in the open on
    <a href="https://codeberg.org/atomdrift" target="_blank">Codeberg</a>
    and released under the Apache 2.0 license. Reproducible security
    tooling must be free software.</p>

